+# RimRound Feed Other v1.0.69-beta.18 testing
+
+## Romantic hearts
+
+1. Complete Share Meal with two spouses or lovers while at least one still needs recreation.
+2. During the post-meal conversation phase, confirm one vanilla heart appears about every 300 ticks and alternates between the partners.
+3. Repeat with one-way Feed Other and awake bedside feeding.
+4. Confirm non-romantic pairs never produce hearts.
+5. Confirm hearts stop when the conversation ends and do not create Lovin' memories or pregnancy checks.
+
+## Hidden food pipes
+
+1. Load an existing save containing completed Food Network pipes.
+2. Outside placement/overlay display, confirm completed pipes are invisible.
+3. Select a Food Network build designator and confirm the existing food-grid overlay reveals the connected pipe layout.
+4. Confirm blueprints and construction frames remain visible.
+5. Confirm valves, tanks, dispensers, processors, distillers and feeders remain normally visible and connected.
+6. Test the selected-network and always-show overlay settings.
